00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:14.533
They come gift-boxed, ready to give.

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:17.287
Twenty-eight dollars each, or all four for ninety.

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:18.933
Free shipping this week only.

00:00:19.147 --> 00:00:20.607
Tap the link and pick yours.
